2e1ad1c9e58fd92144821bb86cfbe1fdf2ca3506d2d7da8bfa9b9223637c50bba50eb79d90080c053928e72563cfcf129c7132d994886a5065b385702ab21a00  shell-Fix-unsigned-char-promotion-and-truncation.patch
"
